        "curriculum_hours_per_week": 6,
        "teacher_training_hours": 40,
        "hands_on_lab_ratio": 0.5
      },
      "rationale": "Stronger STEM education correlates with improved academic outcomes and higher perceived returns to schooling, encouraging learners to remain enrolled longer."
    },
    {
      "name": "Early Dialogic Reading Program",
      "description": "Deploy structured interactive reading sessions in which learners and facilitators engage in conversation about stories to build comprehension and motivation.",
      "mechanism_type": "education_dialogic_reading_modality",
      "target_population": "Learners",
      "parameters": {
        "target_age_min": 4,
        "target_age_max": 8,
        "sessions_per_week": 3,
        "group_size": 6
      },
      "rationale": "Dialogic reading strengthens foundational literacy and language skills early in the educational trajectory, creating the base proficiency that supports continuous progression through school."
    }
  ],
  "rationale": "This integrated policy leverages four distinct, evidence-grounded lever mechanisms drawn directly from the derived lever space. By addressing both foundational skills and advanced curricular engagement, and by reforming both modality and method, the draft targets multiple decision points that influence learner retention. It respects the constraint against unverified promotion by keeping each intervention tightly bound to its established pedagogical function and actor population.",
